class Solution(object):
    def swapPairs(self, head):
        """
        :type head: Optional[ListNode]
        :rtype: Optional[ListNode]
        """
        if head is None or head.next is None:
            return head
        pre = head 
        cur = head.next
        fut = head.next.next

        cur.next = pre
        pre.next = self.swapPairs(fut)

        return cur

Notes:
the key is to understand the recursive nature of the function and how the nodes are swapped in pairs.

